<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About Us - Multi-Merchant E-commerce</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #333;
    }
    header {
      background-color: #4a6cf7;
      color: white;
      padding: 1rem 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
    .page-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }
    .about-content {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    }
    .about-section {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .team-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    .team-member {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid #eee;
      border-radius: 5px;
      transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    }
    .team-member:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .team-member img {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .team-member h3 {
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
      color: #4a6cf7;
    }
    .team-member p {
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
      color: #666;
    }
    footer {
      background-color: #333;
      color: white;
      padding: 2rem 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Multi-Merchant E-commerce</h2>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <h1 class="page-title">About Us</h1>
    
    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-section">
        <h2>Our Story</h2>
        <p>
          Founded in 2023, our multi-merchant e-commerce platform was created with a simple mission: to provide a seamless online marketplace where merchants can easily sell their products and customers can find everything they need in one place.
        </p>
        <p>
          We believe in empowering small and medium-sized businesses by giving them the tools they need to succeed in the digital marketplace. Our platform is designed to be user-friendly, secure, and scalable, allowing merchants to focus on what they do best - creating and selling amazing products.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="about-section">
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          Our mission is to create a thriving ecosystem where merchants and customers can connect and transact with confidence. We strive to provide:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>A user-friendly platform for merchants to showcase their products</li>
          <li>A secure and reliable shopping experience for customers</li>
          <li>Innovative tools and features that drive business growth</li>
          <li>Exceptional customer service and support</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="about-section">
        <h2>Our Team</h2>
        <p>
          Behind our platform is a dedicated team of professionals passionate about e-commerce and technology. We combine expertise in web development, user experience design, and business operations to deliver a platform that meets the needs of both merchants and customers.
        </p>
        
        <div class="team-grid">
          <div class="team-member">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Team Member">
            <h3>John Doe</h3>
            <p>Founder & CEO</p>
          </div>
          <div class="team-member">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Team Member">
            <h3>Jane Smith</h3>
            <p>CTO</p>
          </div>
          <div class="team-member">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Team Member">
            <h3>Michael Johnson</h3>
            <p>Head of Design</p>
          </div>
          <div class="team-member">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Team Member">
            <h3>Sarah Williams</h3>
            <p>Customer Success</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>&copy; {{ currentYear() }} Multi-Merchant E-commerce Platform. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
